00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:57.460
 Diagnostic discovery, refining, and blueprint, and really simply boiling it down.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:02.460
 It started with us getting under contract in the spring, late spring, April.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:06.460
 And we started a process on data collection and looking at the existing conditions,

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:12.460
 understanding the current transit network or lack thereof, a transit network in this part of the valley.

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:15.460
 Really understanding city land use and zoning plans.

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:19.460
 And we have spent several months with many of your city staff on doing that.

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:22.460
 And really anchoring ourselves to data, right?

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:26.460
 So everything is founded on this good foundation that we really understand as best we can.

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:29.460
 Communities that we're trying to help plan a vision for.

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:33.460
