 One of the other areas that we've talked about with the partnership a lot is sort of what we call the five D's of transit oriented development and literally transit oriented development is, is building around transit nodes, around stations or activity centers in which transit

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:09.460
 is part of.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:25.460
 And the importance of thinking about these five pillars as ingredients, if you will, to creating good, vibrant transit oriented communities that connect to, connects your cities within each other and connects to the larger region.

